string Version = " Version 2.2 ";  // 2006-08-10 alf@cadsoft.de
                                    // 2008-04-10 changed GROUP ... (>x y); alf@cadsoft.de
                                    // 2008-05-06 fixed SMD generation with name
                                    // 2010-06-09 fixed PAD name generation.
                                    // 2010-10-15 angle start raised to 720 to place elements
                                    //            clockwise with an end angle larger than 0.0.
                                    //            Example: start 620.0 deg, end 260.1 deg.
                                    //            Here the start angle must be 260+360 = 620 deg.
                                    //            New option: angle offset
                                    // 2011-10-21 Option Group now also accepts radius = 0.
                                    //            The group is now pasted rotated.
                                    //            Checkbox "use selected": uses the group defined
                                    //            before the ULP is started, or the ULP selects all
                                    //            visible objects as the group.
                                    // 2012-04-12 min/max values are absolute and no longer in EAGLE
                                    //            internal units, because of the higher V6 resolution
                                    // 2013-03-26 resolution and max. values adapted to V6 and finer resolution.
                                    // 2013-08-05 output the shape for VIA, fixed HOLE.
                                    // 2013-12-12 added line break <br> in #usage.
                                    // 2026-10-10 EAGLE 9.6.2 adaptation: POLYGON instead of ppour, local .bmp images,
                                    //            SMD clockwise fix, rotate offset for MOVE/SMD, shape/label/error fixes,
                                    //            # and . accepted as step symbols, help notes added.
                                    // 2026-10-10 New: polygon by number of sides (dialog field / parameter K).
                                    // 2026-10-10 Version 2.1: polygon alignment (dialog combo / parameters BH, BV).
                                    // 2026-10-10 Version 2.2: all German text removed (English only); no signal
                                    //            prompt for polygons (signal field removed from the dialog);
                                    //            layer 20 (Dimension) handled for polygons (see below);
                                    //            missing ellipse factor reported inside the dialog.
                                    //            On layer 20 (Dimension) the polygon shape is drawn as a closed WIRE
                                    //            outline (board edge) instead of POLYGON.
                                    //            Layer is mandatory for polygons (active editor layer cannot be read by a ULP).
